  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/create_stam1o_tweaks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lieonlion?sub_confirmation=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/youtube.svg\" alt=\"youtube\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lieonlion/stam1o-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fLieOnLion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LieOnLion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/patreon.svg\" alt=\"patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h3>对 Create（及附属模组）的微调</h3>\n<p>本模组对 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a> 模组及若干附属模组进行了微调与修改。目前已实现的功能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>配方更改</li>\n<li>潜水靴可抵消漂浮效果</li>\n<li>（更多功能即将推出？）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>版本信息</h3>\n<p>目前，仅支持 NeoForge 1.21.1 用于 Create 6 更新。待 Create Fabric 6 更新发布后，1.20.1（Forge 和 Fabric）版本也将获得更新。</p>\n<h3>新功能</h3>\n<p>所有功能均由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Stam1o\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stam1o</a> 本人完全掌控。如需提议新功能，请加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/dM46ckZ2Kv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Create SMP</a> 或 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Cy9wpgBSP2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stam's Jam</a> 的 Discord 服务器。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisect.lieonlion.dev%252fcurseforge%252fstam1o_tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/banners/bisect-banner-spruce-chest.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
